sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Store as SecureFileStore
    participant KS as Keystore (Ch 20/24)
    participant FP as FileProvider
    participant Viewer as External app

    App->>Store: writePrivate("invoice.pdf", bytes, encrypted=true)
    Store->>KS: get/unwrap DEK
    Store->>Store: AES-GCM encrypt -> filesDir/invoice.pdf.enc
    App->>Store: shareUri("invoice.pdf")
    Store->>Store: decrypt to a temp cache file (if recipient needs plaintext)
    Store->>FP: getUriForFile(tempFile)
    FP-->>App: content://authority/...
    App->>Viewer: Intent + FLAG_GRANT_READ_URI_PERMISSION
    Note over Viewer: temporary scoped read, no world exposure
